  <item>
    <title>E06 ta精神正常吗？谁摸大腿？｜房间里有海龟汤记得喝</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670b6861db2cf82757d15184</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670b6861db2cf82757d15184</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Oct 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当当当当！我们房间的海龟汤终于上桌啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目“宴请“嘉宾橙宝🍊和我们一起共享海龟汤！三位主播开启大乱炖模式～本期节目由于三人风格是搞笑的所以是属于阖家欢乐嗑瓜子必备收听的一期哦！</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>海龟汤是一种情境推理游戏，也被称为水平思考拼图游戏。‌ 大家通过提出问题和回答问题的方式，逐步揭示事件的真相。出题者只能回答“是”、“不是”或“与此无关”，这种游戏方式既刺激又充满乐趣‌。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>海龟汤游戏通常包括一个引人入胜的开场事件（称为“汤面”），玩家通过提问逐步揭开事件的谜底（称为“汤底”）。游戏过程中，题目中常常包含意想不到的转折和出人意料的结局，增加了游戏的趣味性和挑战性‌</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：The game of love -Santana/Michelle Branch</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 富豪爱妻的离奇死亡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 请求上诉的女孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 信天翁三明治杀人事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 唯一幸运的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> snake滋～滋～滋～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 派对上的幸存者&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1878">31:18</a> “你太令我失望了 我永远不会回来了”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 吃饭还掀桌子啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> &nbsp;关灯 睡觉 死了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2708">45:08</a> 惊！七旬老汉被虐待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2853">47:33</a> 娱乐圈的秘闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3091">51:31</a> 开枪把自己干了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3268">54:28</a> 吃仓鼠还是吃巧克力（屎尿屁组合大闹巧克力）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3815">01:03:35</a> 兄弟，我这次恐怕要进去了&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4237">01:10:37</a> &nbsp;田野男尸</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu4vyyISQbEM30JhWq1bKooPjiGT.m4a" length="77404204" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:19:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg_4HOvSMrIEMgYrvo6azt9vfHUQ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
